@startuml Runtime_Element_Linking_Flow
!theme aws-orange
title Runtime Element Linking: от WorkflowNode до RPA координат
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
  BorderColor #4169E1
}
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
  FontColor black
}
scale 0.8

start

' === Workflow Step Initiation ===
partition "**🎯 Workflow Step Initiation**" #LightBlue {
  :⚙️ **Receive WorkflowNode**\nОт Orchestrator для выполнения;
  :📋 **WorkflowNode Details:**\n• step_type: "click_add_to_cart"\n• target_element_type: AddToCartButtonElement\n• page_context: ProductDetailPage\n• interaction_params: {product_variant: "default"}\n• expected_outcome: "cart_count_increment";
  :📍 **Current Execution Context:**\n• current_page: ProductDetailPage\n• user_state: authenticated\n• cart_state: {items: 2, total: $15.50}\n• screen_resolution: 1920x1080;
  note right
    **Workflow Input:**
    • Abstract element reference
    • No specific coordinates yet
    • Page context for disambiguation
    • Expected interaction outcome
  end note
}

' === Current Screen Capture ===
partition "**📸 Current Screen Analysis**" #LightGreen {
  :📱 **Capture Current Screenshot**\ncurrent_screen.png (1920x1080);
  :🔍 **LayoutML Processing**\nИзвлечение структуры страницы;
  :📊 **Detected UI Elements:**\n• Button elements: 5 detected\n• Link elements: 12 detected\n• Form elements: 2 detected\n• Image elements: 8 detected\n• Text elements: 25 detected;
  :🎯 **Element Classification:**\nДля каждого элемента определить тип и роль;
  note right
    **LayoutML Output:**
    • Bounding boxes for all elements
    • Element type classification
    • Visual feature extraction
    • Hierarchical DOM structure
  end note
}

' === Cache Lookup ===
partition "**💾 Element Linking Cache Lookup**" #LightYellow {
  :🔍 **Query Element Cache**\nПоиск cached элементов для текущей страницы;
  :📊 **Cache Lookup Query:**\npage_type: ProductDetailPage\nelement_type: AddToCartButtonElement\ncache_validity: < 1 hour;

  if (**Cache hit found?**) then (✅ yes)
    :💾 **Load Cached Linking**\n• element_id: btn_add_cart_001\n• last_coordinates: (850, 650)\n• confidence: 0.87\n• last_seen: 15 minutes ago;
    :🔍 **Validate Cache Freshness**\nПроверка актуальности cached данных;
    if (**Cache still valid?**) then (yes)
      :⚡ **Use Cached Coordinates**\nБыстрый путь выполнения;
    else (outdated)
      :🔄 **Cache invalidated**\nПереходим к real-time linking;
    endif
  else (❌ miss)
    :🔍 **Proceed to real-time linking**\nCache miss, нужен full linking process;
  endif
}

' === Cross-view Matching ===
partition "**🔗 Cross-view Element Matching**" #Lavender {
  :🧠 **Load Cross-view Templates**\nИз BPG Entity Layer;
  :📋 **AddToCartButton Templates:**\n• **Template A**: Orange button, "Add to Cart" text\n• **Template B**: Icon + text, bottom-right position\n• **Template C**: Large CTA button, center placement;
  :🎨 **Multi-modal Similarity Matching:**\n\n**Visual Matching:**\n• CLIP embeddings similarity: 0.91\n• Color/shape analysis: 0.87\n• Size/position consistency: 0.83\n\n**Textual Matching:**\n• OCR text extraction: "Add to Cart"\n• Text similarity score: 0.95\n• Language/localization match: 1.0\n\n**Structural Matching:**\n• DOM path similarity: 0.79\n• CSS class consistency: 0.88\n• Relative positioning: 0.92;
  :📊 **Combined Confidence Score:**\nweighted_average(\n  visual: 0.87 × 0.3,\n  textual: 0.95 × 0.4,\n  structural: 0.86 × 0.3\n) = **0.89**;
  note right
    **Cross-view Strategy:**
    • Compare with known element templates
    • Multi-modal similarity scoring
    • Account for layout variations
    • Handle A/B test differences
  end note
}

' === Coordinate Extraction ===
partition "**📍 Coordinate Extraction**" #LightCoral {
  :🎯 **Best Match Element Identified**\nelement_bbox: (720, 620, 180, 45)\nconfidence: 0.89;
  :📐 **Calculate Click Coordinates:**\n\n**Center Point Calculation:**\n• x_center = bbox.x + bbox.width/2 = 810\n• y_center = bbox.y + bbox.height/2 = 642\n\n**Click Strategy Optimization:**\n• center_click: (810, 642) - standard\n• offset_click: (815, 645) - avoid conflicts\n• safe_zone_click: (808, 640) - accessible area;
  :✅ **Selected Coordinates: (810, 642)**\nОптимальная точка для клика;
  :🔍 **Coordinate Validation:**\n• Within screen bounds: ✓\n• Not overlapped by other elements: ✓\n• In clickable area: ✓\n• Matches expected element size: ✓;
  note right
    **Coordinate Strategy:**
    • Prefer element center points
    • Avoid edge cases and overlaps
    • Account for scroll position
    • Validate clickability
  end note
}

' === RPA Execution ===
partition "**🤖 RPA Action Execution**" #PaleGreen {
  :🖱️ **Execute Click Action**\nPlaywright.click(x=810, y=642);
  :⏱️ **Action Timing:**\n• Pre-action wait: 200ms\n• Click duration: 50ms\n• Post-action wait: 500ms;
  :📸 **Capture Post-action Screenshot**\nДля верификации результата;
  :🔍 **Verify Expected Outcome**\nПроверка успешности действия;
  if (**Expected outcome achieved?**) then (✅ success)
    :📈 **Update Success Metrics**\n• element_confidence += 0.05\n• linking_success_rate += 1\n• coordinates marked as reliable;
    :💾 **Update Cache**\nСохранить успешный linking;
    :📊 **Cache Update:**\n• coordinates: (810, 642)\n• confidence: 0.94 (improved)\n• timestamp: now()\n• success_count: +1;
  else (❌ failure)
    :📉 **Handle Action Failure**\nАнализ причин неудачи;
    :🔄 **Failure Analysis:**\n• Element not clickable at coordinates?\n• Page layout changed during execution?\n• Dynamic content loading conflict?\n• Element moved/hidden after detection?;
    if (**Retry with alternative coordinates?**) then (yes)
      :🎯 **Try Alternative Click Points**\n• offset_coordinates: (815, 645)\n• edge_coordinates: (750, 642)\n• fallback_coordinates: (850, 642);
    else (no fallback)
      :👥 **Escalate to HITL**\nТребуется человеческое вмешательство;
      stop
    endif
  endif
}

' === Learning and Optimization ===
partition "**🎓 Learning and Cache Optimization**" #Moccasin {
  :📊 **Collect Execution Metrics**\n• linking_accuracy: 0.89\n• coordinate_precision: successful\n• execution_time: 1.2 seconds\n• user_satisfaction: (pending);
  :🧠 **Update Cross-view Templates**\nНа основе успешного linking;
  :🔄 **Template Learning:**\n• Visual template confidence += 0.03\n• Structural patterns reinforced\n• Coordinate optimization data stored\n• Error patterns (if any) recorded;
  :💾 **Optimize Cache Strategy**\nУлучшение caching эффективности;
  :📈 **Cache Optimization:**\n• Increase TTL for successful linkings\n• Prioritize high-confidence templates\n• Improve cache hit prediction\n• Reduce memory footprint;
  note right
    **Continuous Improvement:**
    • Successful linkings → higher confidence
    • Failed attempts → alternative strategies
    • User corrections → ground truth data
    • Performance metrics → optimization
  end note
}

stop

' === Легенда ===
legend bottom
**🔎 Легенда:**
• Workflow Step Initiation — входные данные WorkflowNode
• Current Screen Analysis — обработка скриншота и LayoutML
• Cache Lookup — проверка кэша
• Cross-view Matching — сопоставление с шаблонами
• Coordinate Extraction — вычисление координат
• RPA Action Execution — выполнение действия
• Learning & Optimization — обучение и улучшение
end legend

@enduml